    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lending to the private sector increased to 15% of GDP in 2015 (2008-2011 baseline: average of 12.5% of GDP) 
Progress/Status: Credit to the private sector increased to 16.3% of GDP in 2013 
Data Source: International Monetary Fund, International Financial Statistics Online 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
